@startuml TimeLockPuzzle
!include ../../style.puml

title TimeLockPuzzle Struct

class TimeLockPuzzle <<struct>> {
    + input: bytes
    + rsaModulus: Integer
}

note right of TimeLockPuzzle
  **TimeLockPuzzle Struct**
  
  Cryptographic timelock puzzle structure.
  All puzzles share a common protocol
  timing parameter 't'.
end note

note bottom of TimeLockPuzzle
  **Protocol Parameter**
  
  Global timing parameter 't' defines
  the computational difficulty for
  all timelock puzzles in the system.
end note

@enduml